    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16491" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστερ-ισμός</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>marking with stars,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Geog.</u>
				1.22.4
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				205
			</span></i>; <i>arrangement of constellations,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς Ἀργοῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hipparch.
					1.8.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.1.12
			</span></i>; <i>a starry ornament,</i>
			f.l. for foreg. in <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				19.34
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταστερισμός</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Herm.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.49.44
			</span></i>.</div>
